  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p>Now, using the expansion of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>∞</mo></math> we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>∞</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>∞</mo></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>3</mn></msup><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>∞</mo></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo> </mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mtext>as</mtext><mo> </mo><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></munder><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext> and other terms will become zero</mtext></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
